---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — AICost Matrix" description="Privacy policy for aicost.apexcraftweb.com" canonical="https://aicost.apexcraftweb.com/privacy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>AICost Matrix (aicost.apexcraftweb.com) is a free, static website. Budget calculations and usage parsing run in your browser. The tool code does not upload pasted records, store them in browser storage or put them into URL parameters. Calculation exports omit raw response content and message IDs. Clear records before leaving a shared device. Opening the site still sends normal page requests to our hosting provider, which may process access logs such as IP address and request metadata.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>The application code includes no third-party analytics or record-upload endpoint. Hosting-level analytics may count page requests. Do not paste API keys or personal information. Browser extensions and shared devices are outside this tool’s control.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>Links to provider documentation are ordinary reference links. This release does not include affiliate checkout links. See our <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>See <a href="/methodology">sources and methodology</a> for supported fields and limitations.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
